  "52aff168-22ce-be4b-9794-51ddd7905c5f"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an options for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["AnnalyzeTagging",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/AnnalyzeTagging"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"801128d8-00f1-534d-9b12-08a047ccac43"],
 ". It is the weight of the new frame when updating the reference image, \
reference = (1 - w) reference + w frame."
}], "Usage",
